# Benchmark corpora and generated runs are intentionally local. Only the
# reproducible harness, schemas, tiny synthetic fixtures, and explicitly
# published evidence under reports/public belong in git.
Benchmarks/datasets/
Benchmarks/runs/
Benchmarks/reports/*.json
Benchmarks/reports/*.md
!Benchmarks/reports/.gitkeep
Benchmarks/__pycache__/
